---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const API_BASE = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_API_URL || "http://localhost:8787";

let overview = null;
let budget = null;

try {
  const [overviewRes, budgetRes] = await Promise.all([
    fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/overview`),
    fetch(`${API_BASE}/api/budget`),
  ]);
  if (overviewRes.ok) overview = await overviewRes.json();
  if (budgetRes.ok) budget = await budgetRes.json();
} catch {
  // API not available, render with placeholder data
}
---

<Base>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 pt-8 pb-24">
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="pt-10 pb-6 mb-4">
      <p class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold leading-snug mb-1">
        <span class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl tracking-[-0.03em]">解字</span><span class="font-mono text-xs text-ink-muted tracking-widest uppercase ml-2">jiě zì</span>
        <span class="mx-2 text-ink-muted font-normal">—</span>资助 <span class="font-mono text-vermillion">600</span> 名大学生，免费获得 AI 编程工具。
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted leading-relaxed mb-5 border-l-2 border-vermillion pl-3">
        取自《说文解字》。字是语言最小的构成单位，token 是大模型最小的构成单位。个人出资 15 万元，分三个阶段提供 AI Coding Plan、云服务器和 API Token。不限专业，不限基础。
      </p>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
        <a href="https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant" class="inline-block bg-vermillion text-white font-medium text-sm px-5 py-2.5 hover:bg-vermillion-hover transition-colors">
          GitHub 了解详情
        </a>
        <a href="#apply" class="inline-block border border-ink text-ink font-medium text-sm px-5 py-2.5 hover:bg-ink hover:text-paper transition-colors">
          如何申请
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Stats -->
    <section class="mb-24 border-y-2 border-ink">
      <!-- Batch progress -->
      <div class="py-6">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-4">
          <span class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-muted">资助批次</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-muted">每批 100 人 · 共 600 人</span>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-6 gap-2">
          {(overview?.batches ?? Array.from({length: 6}, (_, i) => ({id: i+1, status: "preparing", approved: 0}))).map((batch: any) => (
            <div class={`text-center py-3 border ${batch.status === 'open' ? 'border-vermillion bg-vermillion/[0.05]' : batch.status === 'closed' ? 'border-ink bg-ink/[0.04]' : 'border-border'}`}>
              <p class="font-mono text-lg font-bold tabular-nums">{batch.approved || 0}<span class="text-ink-muted font-normal text-xs">/100</span></p>
              <p class="text-[10px] font-mono text-ink-muted mt-0.5">第 {batch.id} 批</p>
              <p class={`text-[10px] font-mono mt-0.5 ${batch.status === 'open' ? 'text-vermillion' : batch.status === 'closed' ? 'text-ink' : 'text-ink-muted'}`}>
                {batch.status === 'open' ? '申请中' : batch.status === 'closed' ? '已结束' : '筹备中'}
              </p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-3">每人获得 1 个月 AI Coding Plan（MiniMax Plus 极速版），支持 Claude Code、Cline 等主流工具</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Budget progress -->
      <div class="py-5 border-t border-border">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-2">
          <span class="font-mono text-sm text-ink-muted">预算</span>
          <span class="font-mono text-sm">
            <span class="text-vermillion font-bold">{budget ? Math.round(budget.spent).toLocaleString() : "0"}</span>
            <span class="text-ink-muted"> / {budget?.committed?.toLocaleString() ?? "150,000"} CNY</span>
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full h-1.5 bg-ink/[0.06] overflow-hidden">
          <div
            class="h-full bg-vermillion transition-all duration-500"
            style={`width: ${budget ? Math.max((budget.spent / budget.committed) * 100, 0.5) : 0.5}%`}
          ></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">为什么</h2>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted tracking-widest uppercase">Why</span>
      </div>
      
      <div class="border-l-2 border-vermillion pl-4">
        <p class="text-ink leading-relaxed">
          公元 100 年，许慎写成《说文解字》，将九千多个汉字逐一拆解到最小的构件——部首。这是人类第一次对语言进行系统性的原子级解析。两千年后，语言的最小单位变了，叫 token。
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-ink leading-relaxed">
        大语言模型将一切文字、代码、推理拆解为 token 来处理。谁拥有足够的 token，谁就能让 AI 为自己工作。Token 之于今天的 AI，正如文字之于两千年前的知识——掌握它的人获得力量，被它挡在门外的人只能旁观。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 bg-ink/[0.03] p-6 border-l-2 border-ink-muted">
        <p class="text-ink italic leading-relaxed">
          "所有的年轻人都知道不会用 AI 就找不到工作，但他们只能每个月浅尝辄止。Token 太贵了，如果使用 Claude MAX，那就是他们一半的生活费。"
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4">
          <a href="https://x.com/CTracy0803/status/2038452420330811482" class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted hover:text-vermillion transition-colors">— @CTracy0803</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg font-medium text-ink">
        《说文解字》让文字不再是贵族的专属。解字计划要做同样的事：让 token 不再是大学生的门槛。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Stages -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">三个阶段</h2>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted tracking-widest uppercase">Three Stages</span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-ink-muted mb-8">
        体验 → 实践 → 长期支持。每个阶段设有门槛，目的不是淘汰，而是识别真正想做事的人。面向所有在校大学生，不限专业，不限基础。
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- Stage 1 -->
        <div class="border-l border-vermillion/40 bg-ink/[0.02] rounded-sm p-6">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif">体验期 | 600 人</h3>
            <span class="border border-vermillion/30 text-vermillion text-xs font-serif px-1.5 py-0.5">1 个月</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-1">让每一个想接触 AI 的大学生，都有机会亲手体验。</p>
          
          <div class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-vermillion">·</span>
              <span>AI Coding Plan — 支持 Claude Code、Cline、Roo Code 等主流编程工具</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-vermillion">·</span>
              <span>当前供应商：MiniMax Plus 极速版（100 TPS 极速推理）</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-border/50">
            <p class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider">门槛：提交申请 PR · 每批 100 人 · 先到先得</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-muted italic">
              "这是无条件赠送——不要求提交成果。但如果你想进入第二阶段，你需要在体验期结束后拿出东西来。"
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 2 -->
        <div class="border-l-2 border-vermillion bg-ink/[0.02] rounded-sm p-6">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif">深度资助 | ~60 人</h3>
            <span class="border border-vermillion/30 text-vermillion text-xs font-serif px-1.5 py-0.5">3 个月</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-1">第一阶段让你体验 AI，第二阶段让你用 AI 做出东西。</p>

          <div class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-vermillion">·</span>
              <span>AI Coding Plan — 3 个月</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-vermillion">·</span>
              <span>云服务器 — 1 年</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-vermillion">·</span>
              <span>API Token — $50 额度（OpenRouter）</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-border/50">
            <p class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider">门槛：50 star GitHub 项目 · AI agent 辅助创建 · 发起人人工评审</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-muted">
              "达到 50 star 即可获得与发起人的 1v1 交流。通过评审后，还有项目宣传和实习对接。"
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Stage 3 -->
        <div class="border-l-4 border-vermillion bg-ink/[0.02] rounded-sm p-6">
          <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-serif">长期资助 | 3-5 人</h3>
            <span class="border border-vermillion/30 text-vermillion text-xs font-serif px-1.5 py-0.5">1 年</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted mt-1">持续学习的人，值得持续的支持。</p>

          <div class="mt-4 space-y-1 text-sm">
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-vermillion">·</span>
              <span>AI Coding Plan — 1 年</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex gap-2">
              <span class="text-vermillion">·</span>
              <span>API Token — $200 额度</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-border/50">
            <p class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted uppercase tracking-wider">门槛：从第二阶段中选拔 · 综合评估</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-xs text-ink-muted italic">
              "没有固定公式——我们关注你是否在持续学习，做出的东西是否解决了真实问题，以及你是否有长期做下去的意愿。"
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- How to Apply -->
    <section id="apply" class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">如何申请</h2>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted tracking-widest uppercase">How to Apply</span>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-vermillion/30 p-3 text-sm mb-8">
        <span class="text-vermillion font-serif mr-2">【草案阶段】</span>
        <span class="text-ink-muted">所有政策和规则仍在完善中，预计 2026-05-15 正式发布。第一阶段申请尚未开放。</span>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="border-y border-border py-6">
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold">让你的 code agent 帮你申请</h3>
          <div class="bg-ink/[0.03] p-4 font-mono text-sm mt-3 border-l border-ink/10">
            我要申请 jiezi-ai/grant
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-ink-muted mt-3">
            "告诉 Claude Code、Cursor 或 Cline 这句话，agent 会自动完成 Star、Fork、创建申请文件、提交 PR。"
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-y border-border py-6">
          <h3 class="font-serif font-bold">手动申请</h3>
          <ol class="text-sm mt-3 list-decimal pl-5 space-y-1 text-ink-muted">
            <li>Star 仓库</li>
            <li>Fork 仓库</li>
            <li>在 <code class="bg-ink/[0.05] px-1 rounded">students/batch-1/</code> 下创建你的用户名.md</li>
            <li>提交 PR</li>
            <li>通过 edu 邮箱验证后发放资源</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Founder -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">发起人</h2>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted tracking-widest uppercase">Founder</span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-ink">
        我是 <a href="https://x.com/yan5xu" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">@yan5xu</a>（许长鹏），前 Manus AI & Monica AI 工程师。2023 年加入 AI Agent 浪潮，参与构建了 Manus（世界级 AI Agent 产品）和 Monica（1000 万用户）。离开后投入开源社区，创建了 Pinix 和 bb-browser。
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 text-ink-muted leading-relaxed">
        我也曾是大学生。我理解那种感受——明明知道一个工具能改变自己的轨迹，却因为成本只能浅尝辄止。解字计划第一年，我个人出资 15 万元人民币，资助 600 名大学生接触和深度使用 AI。
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Transparency -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">公开透明</h2>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted tracking-widest uppercase">Transparency</span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-ink-muted mb-6">
        从前有逸夫楼、田家炳中学，token 助学是新事物，但透明和信任的原则不变。所有政策、预算、支出记录对外公开。
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        {[
          { label: "政策", path: "policy/", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/tree/main/policy" },
          { label: "预算", path: "BUDGET.md", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/blob/main/BUDGET.md" },
          { label: "时间线", path: "TIMELINE.md", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/blob/main/TIMELINE.md" },
          { label: "支出记录", path: "records/spending.md", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/blob/main/records/spending.md" },
          { label: "批次记录", path: "records/batches.md", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/blob/main/records/batches.md" },
          { label: "beancount 账本", path: "ledger/", url: "https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/tree/main/ledger" },
        ].map(item => (
          <a href={item.url} class="block border border-border p-4 hover:border-vermillion transition-colors group flex justify-between items-start">
            <div>
              <span class="font-serif font-bold text-sm group-hover:text-vermillion">{item.label}</span>
              <span class="block text-[10px] text-ink-muted mt-1 font-mono uppercase tracking-tighter">{item.path}</span>
            </div>
            <span class="text-ink-muted group-hover:text-vermillion transition-colors text-sm">→</span>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Budget -->
    <section class="mb-24">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif">预算</h2>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-ink-muted tracking-widest uppercase">Budget</span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-ink-muted mb-6">第一年总预算 150,000 CNY，发起人个人出资。</p>

      <div class="border-y-2 border-ink py-4 font-mono text-sm">
        <div class="divide-y divide-dashed divide-border/50">
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2">
            <span>第一阶段 体验期</span>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span>58,800 CNY</span>
              <span class="text-ink-muted w-10 text-right">43%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2">
            <span>第二阶段 深度资助</span>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span>63,240 CNY</span>
              <span class="text-ink-muted w-10 text-right">46%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2">
            <span>第三阶段 长期资助</span>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span>13,080 CNY</span>
              <span class="text-ink-muted w-10 text-right">10%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex justify-between py-2">
            <span>运营成本</span>
            <div class="flex gap-4">
              <span>≈1,339 CNY</span>
              <span class="text-ink-muted w-10 text-right">1%</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-t-2 border-ink pt-2 mt-2 flex justify-between font-bold">
          <span>合计</span>
          <div class="flex gap-4">
            <span>≈136,459 CNY</span>
            <span class="text-ink-muted w-10 text-right">100%</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 bg-ink/[0.02] p-6 font-mono text-sm border border-border/50">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-3">
          <span class="text-ink-muted">承诺注资</span>
          <span class="tabular-nums font-medium">{budget?.committed?.toLocaleString() ?? "150,000"} CNY</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline mb-3">
          <span class="text-ink-muted">已支出</span>
          <span class="tabular-nums font-medium">{budget ? Math.round(budget.spent).toLocaleString() : "0"} CNY</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-baseline border-t border-ink/10 pt-3 mt-3">
          <span class="font-bold">实时余额</span>
          <span class="font-bold tabular-nums text-lg text-vermillion">{budget ? Math.round(budget.remaining).toLocaleString() : "150,000"} CNY</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[10px] text-ink-muted mt-4 uppercase tracking-widest">数据每日 00:00 UTC+8 更新</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer class="mt-32 pt-12 border-t border-border text-center pb-12">
      <div class="text-sm text-ink-muted mb-8 space-y-2">
        <p>
          发起人：<a href="https://x.com/yan5xu" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">@yan5xu</a>
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;
          <a href="https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">GitHub</a>
          &nbsp;·&nbsp;
          <a href="https://github.com/jiezi-ai/grant/tree/main/policy" class="text-vermillion hover:underline">政策</a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest">
          Content Licensed under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" class="underline hover:text-vermillion">CC BY 4.0</a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="inline-block bg-vermillion text-white font-serif text-xs px-3 py-1.5 select-none hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300 mb-8" style="clip-path: polygon(2% 0%, 100% 1%, 98% 100%, 0% 98%)">
        解字
      </div>
    </footer>
  </main>
</Base>
